{"seq":2,"slug":"detection-analysis","title":"检测与分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"siem-log-analysis","title":"SIEM 与日志分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/siem-log-analysis","wordCount":2767,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-forensics","title":"网络取证与流量分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/network-forensics","wordCount":2484,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"endpoint-forensics","title":"终端取证与内存分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/endpoint-forensics","wordCount":2950,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 检测与分析\n\n本章聚焦安全事件的检测发现与深度分析技术。SIEM 平台与日志分析是安全运营中心的核心能力，通过关联规则和行为基线识别异常。网络取证从流量层面还原攻击路径，结合协议解析与元数据分析定位入侵源头。终端取证则深入主机层面，通过磁盘镜像、内存快照和进程分析获取攻击者的操作痕迹。三者协同构成完整的事件分析能力。\n"}